  "content_excerpt": "📣 新徽章：\"Top Commenter\" 🏅 – WorldQuant BRAIN\n\n \n\n \n\n \n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n \n\n \n\n \n \n \n\n Skip to main content\n\n \n\n \n \n\n \n \n \n \n\n \n\n \n \n \n f\n \n \n BRAIN platform\n\n Community\n \n\n FAQ\n\n \n Submit a request\n \n \n \n\n \n \n PZ96147\n \n \n \n \n \n\n My activities\n My profile\n \n Sign out\n \n\n \n\n \n \n \n \n\n \n English (United States)\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 简体中文\n \n \n \n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n \n\n \n\n \n \n \n \n\n \n WorldQuant BRAIN\n \n \n\n \n \n\n \n Community\n \n \n\n \n \n\n \n 中文论坛\n \n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n\n \n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n \n\n 📣 新徽章：\"Top Commenter\" 🏅\n \n \n\n \n\n \n Featured\n \n \n \n \n \n\n \n\n \n \n \n \n\n \nFollowFollowed by 4 people\n\n \n \n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n \n KJ42842\n \n \n \n \n\n \n \n \n2 years ago\n\n \nEdited\n\n \n \n \n\n \n\n \n \n\n \n\n \n\n我们很高兴向大家介绍一个新的徽章 - \"Top Commenter\"。\n社区成员可以通过积极参与社区中讨论获得该徽章:\n\n   帮助回答其他成员的常见疑问\n\n   分享自己的知识和经验\n\n   完成所参与课程要求的作业\n\n   参与社区中广泛的讨论与交流\n\nBRAIN 团队会管理社区中的事务并定期颁发该徽章。\n该徽章会显赫的展示在个人资料中以及所发布的帖子和评论旁侧, 以突出显示您的等级和对论坛的贡献。\n我们希望大家都可以参与进来共同营造一个开放包容的社区氛围，在量化的旅途中互相学习，共同成长！\n\n \n \n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n\n \n 13\n\n \n \n\n \n\n \n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n \n\n \n \n\n \n\n \n\n Comments\n \n\n \n0 comments\n\n \n \n\n \n \n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n \n\n \nPost is closed for comments.\n\n \n\n \n \n \n\n \nDidn't find what you were looking for?\n\n \n \n New post\n \n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n\n \n\n \n \n\n \n© 2026 WorldQuant BRAIN®. All Rights Reserved.",
